WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.800 --> 00:00:04.724
Crowdin and Lokalise include
unlimited translators or reviewers

2
00:00:04.724 --> 00:00:07.730
on paid plans, but charge
for some other roles.

3
00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.006
General Translation bills
for the work you request,

4
00:00:11.006 --> 00:00:12.572
with unlimited users.

5
00:00:13.650 --> 00:00:17.539
Hosted Weblate includes unlimited
translators and charges for

6
00:00:17.539 --> 00:00:19.059
hosted-string capacity.

7
00:00:19.459 --> 00:00:23.289
Phrase subscriptions include
seats and managed-word capacity.

8
00:00:23.650 --> 00:00:25.194
With General Translation,

9
00:00:25.194 --> 00:00:28.805
inviting reviewers or
developers adds no seat fee,

10
00:00:28.805 --> 00:00:32.275
and the bill follows
translation and agent usage.

11
00:00:32.650 --> 00:00:35.529
When you run npx gt translate,

12
00:00:35.529 --> 00:00:38.629
unchanged source reuses
completed translations,

13
00:00:38.629 --> 00:00:40.358
and new content adds work.

14
00:00:41.150 --> 00:00:43.889
Your team now ships
Italian with each release.
